Would you like to understand a woman’s emotions, needs, libido? Do many other aspects remain a mystery in your relationship? 
Are you looking for the answers on: 
- How to talk to a woman? 
- Why can she seem flighty? 
- Why her sex drive seems to change? 
- What she may want and need?
For those and many more answers to your questions, 'Happy Together' explains in simple terms the science and reasons behind them. Use this application and it will guide you on the path to a fuller and more fun relationship.
 
Created by men, verified by women, proven by improved life together: A man’s calendar of woman's feelings and wishes.
 
Main features:
- science-based but easy to use and understand;
- Simple graphic calendar of a woman's cycle with the possibility of forecasting many months ahead;
- daily information during the cycle and overview of phases;
- tips for everyday life and intimate moments for each day of the cycle;
- quick glance emoticons showing her possible mood on that day of the cycle;
- knowing probable fertile days;
- knowing which days would be best for planning joint events;
- possibility to add one`s own observations for future reference;
- data anonymity;
- hundreds of quotes and thoughts from people around the World;
- fun but effective
